    "localized": {
      "ko_KR": {
        "name": "치명적인 검무",
        "summary": "피오라가 챔피언의 <keywordMajor>급소</keywordMajor> 하나를 드러냅니다. <keywordMajor>급소</keywordMajor>를 가격하면 <healing>체력을 회복</healing>하고 <speed>이동 속도</speed>가 상승합니다.",
        "tooltip": "피오라가 적 챔피언의 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">급소</span>를 찾아냅니다. 기본 공격이나 스킬로 이 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">급소</span>를 가격하면 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">최대 체력에 비례해 (3% + (0.04% 추가 공격력))의 고정 피해</span>를 추가로 입히며 피오라의 <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">이동 속도가</span> 상승했다가 2초에 걸쳐 원래대로 돌아오고 <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">체력을 (35 ~ 100)</span> 회복합니다.<br /><br />15초가 지나거나 피오라가 급소를 가격하면 새로운 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">급소</span>가 드러납니다."
      },
      "en_US": {
        "name": "Duelist's Dance",
        "summary": "Fiora has revealed a <keywordMajor>Vital</keywordMajor> on this Champion. If she hits the <keywordMajor>Vital</keywordMajor>, she <healing>restores Health</healing> and gains <speed>Move Speed</speed>.",
        "tooltip": "Fiora identifies <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Vitals</span> on enemy champions. Hitting this <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Vital</span> with an Attack or Ability deals an additional <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">(3% + (0.04% bonus Attack Damage)) max Health true damage</span>, grants Fiora <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">Move Speed</span> decaying over 2 seconds, and restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(35 ~ 100) Health</span>.<br /><br />Fiora reveals a new <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Vital</span> after 15 seconds or after striking one."
      },
      "zh_CN": {
        "name": "决斗之舞",
        "summary": "菲奥娜已在这名英雄身上发现了一处<keywordMajor>破绽</keywordMajor>。如果她命中了这处<keywordMajor>破绽</keywordMajor>，她就会<healing>回复生命值</healing>并获得<speed>移动速度</speed>。",
        "tooltip": "菲奥娜识别出敌方英雄身上的<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">破绽</span>。用一次攻击或技能命中这个<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">破绽</span>会造成额外的<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">(3% + (0.04% 额外攻击力))最大生命值的真实伤害</span>，并为菲奥娜提供在2秒里持续衰减的<span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">移动速度</span>，并回复<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(35 ~ 100)生命值</span>。<br /><br />菲奥娜会在15秒后或是击中一个<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">破绽</span>后找出一个新破绽。"
      }
    }
  }
}